OL,3,GNEWSACouncil lodges court challenge
OL,4,Aover city expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire County Council has
OL,7,Fcommenced a legal challenge over a move
OL,8,Fto expand Leicester's political
OL,9,Fboundary.
OL,11,FThe Reform UK-led authority said it had
OL,12,Flodged a claim seeking a judicial
OL,13,Freview of a government proposal for a
OL,14,Fmajor shake-up of council boundaries
OL,15,Facross Leicester, Leicestershire and
OL,16,FRutland.
OL,18,FUnder the proposal, some 250,000 people
OL,19,Fcurrently living in the county face
OL,20,Fbeing moved within the boundary of an
OL,21,Fenlarged Leicester council.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
