OL,3,GNEWSACouncil lodges court challenge
OL,4,Aover city expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe process, known as local government
OL,7,Freorganisation (LGR), has been paused
OL,8,Fby the Ministry of Housing, Communities
OL,9,Fand Local Government (MHCLG), which is
OL,10,Freviewing its plans across the country.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
